{"mode":"words","text":"Yllä näet tekstin juuri sellaisena kuin sovellus sen näyttää. Jokainen sana on pieni kortti: yläosassa sana kohdekielelläsi, sen alla sen merkitys äidinkielelläsi — sana sanalta, kohdekielen järjestyksessä. Sen alla on koko lause vielä kerran sujuvasti käännettynä. Kielissä, joissa käytetään erilaista kirjoitusjärjestelmää, mukana on rivi, jossa on translitteraatio, jotta voit lukea kaiken. Napauta sanaa: ääni jatkaa toistamista juuri siitä kohdasta.","words":[{"s":0,"e":337},{"s":406,"e":615},{"s":639,"e":1115},{"s":1173,"e":1428},{"s":1463,"e":1997},{"s":2043,"e":2229},{"s":2276,"e":2728},{"s":2752,"e":2926},{"s":2972,"e":3657},{"s":4098,"e":4528},{"s":4574,"e":4818},{"s":4888,"e":4957},{"s":5016,"e":5341},{"s":5399,"e":6049},{"s":6374,"e":7140},{"s":7187,"e":7442},{"s":7523,"e":8719},{"s":8766,"e":8940},{"s":9021,"e":9195},{"s":9242,"e":9369},{"s":9416,"e":9857},{"s":9938,"e":10913},{"s":11029,"e":11076},{"s":11227,"e":11494},{"s":11552,"e":11993},{"s":12040,"e":12759},{"s":12817,"e":13804},{"s":14187,"e":14396},{"s":14489,"e":14756},{"s":14814,"e":14896},{"s":14954,"e":15232},{"s":15302,"e":15604},{"s":15673,"e":15940},{"s":15987,"e":16289},{"s":16324,"e":16858},{"s":16951,"e":17810},{"s":18413,"e":18901},{"s":18924,"e":19226},{"s":19273,"e":19679},{"s":19749,"e":20225},{"s":20283,"e":21757},{"s":21966,"e":22442},{"s":22512,"e":22628},{"s":22721,"e":23034},{"s":23069,"e":23324},{"s":23348,"e":23417},{"s":23464,"e":24648},{"s":24764,"e":25043},{"s":25077,"e":25217},{"s":25275,"e":25577},{"s":25728,"e":26378},{"s":26889,"e":27318},{"s":27400,"e":27899},{"s":28108,"e":28433},{"s":28456,"e":28804},{"s":28851,"e":29420},{"s":29478,"e":29733},{"s":29757,"e":29977},{"s":30024,"e":30836}]}